---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout basePath="/v2" title="About Us — Ask Astro Raja">
  <!-- PAGE HERO -->
  <section class="py-24 px-4 bg-brand-light-bg relative overflow-hidden text-center">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto relative z-10">
      <div class="text-brand-saffron-dark font-bold tracking-widest uppercase mb-4 text-sm">✦ About Us</div>
      <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-bold leading-[1.1] mb-6 text-brand-navy">
        Vedic wisdom <br />
        <span class="text-brand-saffron italic">for modern lives</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-brand-text max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        Ask Astro Raja was built for Tamil Nadu — for students uncertain about their future, parents seeking clarity for their children, and professionals looking for direction rooted in something deeper than career advice alone.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- MISSION -->
  <section class="py-20 px-4 max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
      <div>
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1524504388940-b1c1722653e1?w=720&h=1000&fit=crop&crop=top" alt="Astro Raja" class="rounded-2xl shadow-xl w-full h-[500px] object-cover" />
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="text-brand-saffron-dark font-bold tracking-widest uppercase mb-4 text-sm">Our Mission</div>
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-6">Making authentic astrology <span class="text-brand-saffron italic">accessible</span></h2>
        <div class="prose prose-lg text-brand-text-muted">
          <p>For generations, Vedic astrology guidance in Tamil Nadu was accessible only through trusted family astrologers — a dying practice as families move to cities and that chain of knowledge breaks. Ask Astro Raja was created to fill that gap.</p>
          <p>We are not a replacement for human wisdom. We are a bridge — a way to get meaningful, Vedic-grounded guidance at any time, tailored to your actual situation, available to anyone with a phone.</p>
          <blockquote class="border-l-4 border-brand-saffron pl-4 italic my-6 text-brand-navy text-2xl">"Astrology does not define your fate. It reveals the terrain — and you choose the path."</blockquote>
          <p>Every report is generated fresh using your exact Raasi, Lagnam, and Nakshatra combination — not a recycled daily horoscope, but a reading shaped by your struggles, your goals, and your life today.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- VALUES -->
  <section class="py-20 px-4 bg-slate-50 border-y border-brand-border/50">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <div class="text-brand-saffron-dark font-bold tracking-widest uppercase mb-4 text-sm">What We Stand For</div>
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-4">Our three <span class="text-brand-saffron italic">principles</span></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-brand-border">
          <div class="text-4xl mb-4">📿</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-3">Authentic, Not Generic</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">We use your precise Raasi, Lagnam, and Nakshatra — not just your zodiac sign. A Meenam person with Thulam Lagnam and Revathi star gets a fundamentally different reading from a Meenam with Mesham Lagnam and Punarpoosam.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-brand-border">
          <div class="text-4xl mb-4">🔒</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-3">Private by Design</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">Your name, birth details, and personal struggles are used only to generate your report. We do not store your data, build profiles on users, or share information with third parties. Your reading is yours alone.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-brand-border">
          <div class="text-4xl mb-4">🌿</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-3">Grounded, Not Superstitious</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">Our reports offer guidance and reflection — not predictions or fear. We deliberately avoid language like "this month will be bad" or "you must do this ritual." Every report is written to empower, not to create dependency.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- WHO IT'S FOR -->
  <section class="py-24 px-4 max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-brand-saffron-dark font-bold tracking-widest uppercase mb-4 text-sm">Who We Serve</div>
    <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-4">Built for <span class="text-brand-saffron italic">real people</span><br/>in real situations</h2>
    <p class="text-brand-text-muted mb-12 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">Ask Astro Raja was designed with four types of users in mind — each with different questions, different pressures, and different needs from a guidance tool.</p>
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <div class="bg-white border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-6 items-start shadow-sm hover:border-brand-saffron transition-colors group">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1529626455594-4ff0802cfb7e?w=144&h=160&fit=crop&crop=top" alt="Student" class="w-20 h-24 sm:w-24 sm:h-28 object-cover rounded-lg flex-shrink-0 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" />
        <div>
          <div class="text-[10px] text-brand-saffron font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">Students</div>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-2">Facing the crossroads</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-brand-text-muted leading-relaxed">After Class 12 or degree completion, the pressure to choose the "right" path is immense. Our report helps students understand their natural strengths and where their Nakshatra energy aligns — giving them language to discuss their choices with parents.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="bg-white border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-6 items-start shadow-sm hover:border-brand-saffron transition-colors group">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1531123897727-8f129e1688ce?w=144&h=160&fit=crop&crop=top" alt="Parent" class="w-20 h-24 sm:w-24 sm:h-28 object-cover rounded-lg flex-shrink-0 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" />
        <div>
          <div class="text-[10px] text-brand-saffron font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">Parents</div>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-2">Seeking clarity for their children</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-brand-text-muted leading-relaxed">Parents in Tamil Nadu often carry the weight of their child's future. Many seek an astrologer not to predict the future, but to feel heard and guided. Our report gives families a shared, grounded framework to discuss direction.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="bg-white border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-6 items-start shadow-sm hover:border-brand-saffron transition-colors group">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506794778202-cad84cf45f1d?w=144&h=160&fit=crop&crop=top" alt="Working professional" class="w-20 h-24 sm:w-24 sm:h-28 object-cover rounded-lg flex-shrink-0 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" />
        <div>
          <div class="text-[10px] text-brand-saffron font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">Professionals</div>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-2">Navigating career transitions</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-brand-text-muted leading-relaxed">Engineers, teachers, entrepreneurs — people mid-career who feel stuck, are considering a change, or need to understand why they feel unfulfilled despite external success. Our report often names what they already feel.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="bg-white border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-6 items-start shadow-sm hover:border-brand-saffron transition-colors group">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1621592484082-4b9d2a36e3b6?w=144&h=160&fit=crop&crop=top" alt="Homemaker" class="w-20 h-24 sm:w-24 sm:h-28 object-cover rounded-lg flex-shrink-0 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" />
        <div>
          <div class="text-[10px] text-brand-saffron font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">Homemakers & Family-Focused</div>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-2">Seeking inner clarity</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-brand-text-muted leading-relaxed">Those who carry many roles — parent, caregiver, family pillar — often have the least space for their own reflection. Our report honours that role while opening space for personal goals, spiritual orientation, and individual direction.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- AI SECTION -->
  <section class="py-24 px-4 bg-brand-navy text-white">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
      <div>
        <div class="text-brand-saffron font-bold tracking-widest uppercase mb-4 text-sm">The Technology</div>
        <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6">Ancient knowledge,<br/><span class="text-brand-saffron-light italic">modern engine</span></h2>
        <p class="text-white/70 mb-4 leading-relaxed">Ask Astro Raja is powered by a large language AI model, carefully guided by a deeply crafted Vedic astrology system prompt built by our founder over months of study and refinement.</p>
        <p class="text-white/70 mb-8 leading-relaxed">The AI does not make up astrology. It applies a structured body of Vedic knowledge to your specific inputs — producing a reading that would take a human astrologer an hour to compose by hand.</p>
        
        <ul class="space-y-4">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="text-brand-saffron mt-1">✦</span>
            <span class="text-white/70 text-sm leading-relaxed">Your Raasi, Lagnam, and Nakshatra are the foundation — not decorative. Each combination produces a meaningfully different report.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="text-brand-saffron mt-1">✦</span>
            <span class="text-white/70 text-sm leading-relaxed">Your four intake answers shape the tone, focus, and recommendations. A student gets different guidance than an entrepreneur with the same Raasi.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="text-brand-saffron mt-1">✦</span>
            <span class="text-white/70 text-sm leading-relaxed">No two reports are identical. Every reading is generated fresh for you.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="text-brand-saffron mt-1">✦</span>
            <span class="text-white/70 text-sm leading-relaxed">Reports are available in PDF and Word format for easy sharing and reference.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      
      <div class="bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-10">
        <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold mb-8 pb-6 border-b border-white/10">How the Report is Built</h3>
        
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-6 pb-6 border-b border-white/5">
            <div class="font-serif text-3xl font-light text-brand-saffron">01</div>
            <div>
              <strong class="block text-white mb-1">Your Vedic Identity</strong>
              <div class="text-sm text-white/50">Raasi + Lagnam + Nakshatra fed into the AI engine</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-6 pb-6 border-b border-white/5">
            <div class="font-serif text-3xl font-light text-brand-saffron">02</div>
            <div>
              <strong class="block text-white mb-1">Context Intake</strong>
              <div class="text-sm text-white/50">4 questions about your current struggles, life, goals and spiritual orientation</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-6 pb-6 border-b border-white/5">
            <div class="font-serif text-3xl font-light text-brand-saffron">03</div>
            <div>
              <strong class="block text-white mb-1">AI Report Generation</strong>
              <div class="text-sm text-white/50">The Vedic system prompt processes all inputs and generates a structured personal report</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-6">
            <div class="font-serif text-3xl font-light text-brand-saffron">04</div>
            <div>
              <strong class="block text-white mb-1">Formatted & Delivered</strong>
              <div class="text-sm text-white/50">Report formatted with clear sections, downloadable as PDF or Word</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- TEAM -->
  <section class="py-24 px-4 border-y border-brand-border">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto text-center">
      <div class="text-brand-saffron-dark font-bold tracking-widest uppercase mb-4 text-sm">The People</div>
      <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-4">Built by people who <span class="text-brand-saffron italic">care</span></h2>
      <p class="text-brand-text-muted mb-16 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">A small team from Tamil Nadu with a shared conviction: that meaningful astrology guidance should be accessible to every family, not just those who know the right astrologer.</p>
      
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <div class="bg-white border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-8 text-center shadow-sm">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506794778202-cad84cf45f1d?w=192&h=208&fit=crop&crop=top" alt="Astro Raja — Founder" class="w-24 h-24 object-cover rounded-full mx-auto mb-6 border-4 border-brand-saffron/20" />
          <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-1">Astro Raja</h3>
          <div class="text-[10px] text-brand-saffron font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">Founder & Vedic Curator</div>
          <p class="text-sm text-brand-text-muted leading-relaxed">20 years of Vedic astrology practice. Built the entire guidance system and prompt architecture behind every report. Based in Tamil Nadu.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-8 text-center shadow-sm">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1529626455594-4ff0802cfb7e?w=192&h=208&fit=crop&crop=top" alt="Tech Lead" class="w-24 h-24 object-cover rounded-full mx-auto mb-6 border-4 border-brand-saffron/20" />
          <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-1">Kavitha M.</h3>
          <div class="text-[10px] text-brand-saffron font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">Product & Technology</div>
          <p class="text-sm text-brand-text-muted leading-relaxed">Full-stack developer and product designer. Built the web platform from the ground up with a focus on simplicity and performance for mobile users across Tamil Nadu.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-8 text-center shadow-sm">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1621592484082-4b9d2a36e3b6?w=192&h=208&fit=crop&crop=top" alt="Content Lead" class="w-24 h-24 object-cover rounded-full mx-auto mb-6 border-4 border-brand-saffron/20" />
          <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-1">Saranya R.</h3>
          <div class="text-[10px] text-brand-saffron font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">Content & Community</div>
          <p class="text-sm text-brand-text-muted leading-relaxed">Manages reader communications, report quality reviews, and the community of users who share feedback to help improve the guidance system over time.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="py-24 px-4 bg-brand-light-bg text-center">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-6">Ready to hear what<br/>your stars <span class="text-brand-saffron italic">say?</span></h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-brand-text-muted mb-10">Your Raasi, Lagnam and Nakshatra have a story. Let us help you read it.</p>
      <a href="/v2/get-reading" class="inline-block px-10 py-4 bg-brand-navy text-white rounded-xl font-bold text-lg hover:bg-brand-saffron transition-colors shadow-lg">
        Begin My Reading — Free
      </a>
      <p class="text-xs text-brand-text-muted mt-6 uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold">No account required · Download instantly · Tamil names supported</p>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
